codex
Another dim-384 tradeoff is where to apply/store the output gate. Current code leaves `out_gate` inside the large projection buffer and sigmoids it in the final kernel. I’m testing the alternate existing path that stores a compact sigmoid gate during post-projection and uses the simpler final kernel.
