codex
The contiguous-hidden output idea is not viable: strided cuBLAS stores make it 8-9x slower locally. I’m not wiring it in, and I’ll remove those trial kernels before finalizing. Next I’ll compare `torch.bmm` with 4D `torch.matmul` using the same contiguous output layout, which may select a different batched GEMM path without changing memory layout.
